edi ch\u00e1u m\u1ea5y con tem c\u0169 c\u1ee7a \u00f4ng. Ch\u00e1u gi\u1eef h\u1ebft nh\u00e9. Tem tuy c\u0169 nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn \u0111\u1eb9p, nh\u1ea5t l\u00e0 con tem m\u00e0u v\u00e0ng.`},{`en`:`[[You]] [[asked|ask]] [[about]] [[my]] [[work]]. [[I]] [[used to]] [[carry]] [[letters|letter]] [[to]] [[every]] [[house]] [[on]] Lotus Street. [[I]] [[used to]] [[ride]] [[a]] [[green]] [[bicycle]] [[with]] [[a]] [[big]] [[bag]]. [[Actually]], [[I]] [[was|be]] [[not]] [[a]] [[fast]] postman. [[According to]] [[my]] [[old]] [[boss]], [[I]] [[was|be]] [[the]] [[slowest|slow]] postman [[in]] [[the]] [[city]], [[because]] [[I]] [[talked|talk]] [[to]] [[everyone]]!`,`vn`:`Ch\u00e1u h\u1ecfi v\u1ec1 c\u00f4ng vi\u1ec7c c\u1ee7a \u00f4ng. Ng\u00e0y tr\u01b0\u1edbc, \u00f4ng mang th\u01b0 \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eebng nh\u00e0 tr\u00ean ph\u1ed1 Hoa Sen. \u00d4ng hay \u0111\u1ea1p chi\u1ebfc xe \u0111\u1ea1p m\u00e0u xanh, ch\u1edf theo m\u1ed9t c\u00e1i t\u00fai to. Th\u1eadt ra \u00f4ng ch\u1eb3ng ph\u1ea3i ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u01b0a th\u01b0 nhanh nh\u1eb9n g\u00ec. S\u1ebfp c\u0169 c\u1ee7a \u00f4ng b\u1ea3o \u00f4ng l\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u01b0a th\u01b0 ch\u1eadm nh\u1ea5t th\u00e0nh ph\u1ed1, v\u00ec g\u1eb7p ai \u00f4ng c\u0169ng d\u1eebng l\u1ea1i n\u00f3i chuy\u1ec7n!`},{`en`:`[[As]] [[a]] postman, [[I]] [[saw|see]] [[such]] [[funny]] [[addresses|address]]. [[Once]], [[a]] [[letter]] [[came|come]] [[with]] [[no]] [[name]] [[on]] [[it]]. [[It]] [[only]] [[said|say]]: \`[[To]] [[the]] [[girl]] [[with]] [[the]] [[yellow]] [[umbrella]].\` [[Whose]] [[letter]] [[was|be]] [[it]]? [[Instead]] [[of]] [[sending|send]] [[it]] [[back]], [[I]] [[looked|look]] [[for]] [[her]].`,`vn`:`L\u00e0m ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u01b0a th\u01b0, \u00f4ng g\u1eb7p \u0111\u1ee7 ki\u1ec3u \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 bu\u1ed3n c\u01b0\u1eddi. C\u00f3 l\u1ea7n, m\u1ed9t l\u00e1 th\u01b0 ch\u1eb3ng ghi t\u00ean ai, ch\u1ec9 ghi: \`G\u1eedi c\u00f4 g\u00e1i c\u1ea7m chi\u1ebfc \u00f4 v\u00e0ng.\` T